            "detailed_description": "Adjacency is a puzzle game about colors and shapes.<br />\r\nSpread colors to adjacent tiles to complete the pattern.<br />\r\nMaster puzzles by solving them with as few moves as possible.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMinimal yet challenging, for the casual or perfectionist player.",
